'''Olympic Sports Center''' ({{Langx|bl|Centro Deportivo Olímpico}}) is an underground [[W:Metro station|station]] of the [[Castejón Metro]] serving the [[Olympic Sports Center (Castejón)|eponymous district]] on the [[Castejón Metro Sagrajas Line|Sagrajas]] line, located in the [[El Capitán]] borough of the [[Castejón Metropolis]]. 

